--------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------

The 15 contamination-probe items per use case (`corpus/*.yaml`
IDs P01–P15) are pre-existing public-domain text — Harvard
sentences (conversational) and literary openings (Dickens, Austen,
Tolstoy, Melville, Doyle, Twain, Joyce; narration). Their inclusion
here does not create any additional rights over that source
material.

Vendor names (ElevenLabs, Cartesia, Fish Audio, Google, Deepgram,
OpenAI, Speechify, Canopy Orpheus / lucataco community-fork on
Replicate) and analyzer names (Meta Audiobox Aesthetics,
Microsoft DNSMOS, NVIDIA Parakeet, Systran faster-whisper, jiwer)
are trademarks of their respective owners and are used here for
factual identification only.

